// How many kept pairs have a labeled margin that appears once.
// No pair returns nothing. One margin returns one.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE mones ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG mones rank

IMPULSE mones 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "mones" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
